description: PHPUnit conventions for Brammo Content
globs: tests/**/*.php
alwaysApply: false
---

# Tests

- Extend `Cake\TestSuite\TestCase`; namespace `Brammo\Content\Test\TestCase\...`.
- Helpers: `new View()` then `new XHelper($view)` in `setUp()`.
- Elements: `$this->View->element('Brammo/Content.{name}', $vars)`; assert `fetch('script')` / `fetch('css')`.
- Protected logic: `ReflectionClass` + `setAccessible(true)` (see `ImageHelperTest`).
- `@var` docblocks must reference `Brammo\Content\View\Helper\*`, not `App\View\Helper\*`.

Bootstrap uses `tests/test_app/webroot/` as `WWW_ROOT`.
